下面是 `OFtutorial10.C` 的完整主程序，省去了说明性注释。程序读取字段和扩散系数，求解一次稳态方程，然后保存 `result`：

```cpp
#include "fvCFD.H"

int main(int argc, char *argv[])
{
    #include "setRootCase.H"
    #include "createTime.H"
    #include "createMesh.H"

    Info << "Reading field beta" << nl << endl;
    volScalarField beta
    (
        IOobject
        (
            "beta",
            runTime.timeName(),
            mesh,
            IOobject::MUST_READ,
            IOobject::AUTO_WRITE
        ),
        mesh
    );

    Info << "Reading field U" << nl << endl;
    volVectorField U
    (
        IOobject
        (
            "U",
            runTime.timeName(),
            mesh,
            IOobject::MUST_READ,
            IOobject::AUTO_WRITE
        ),
        mesh
    );

    Info << "Reading transportProperties\n" << endl;
    IOdictionary transportProperties
    (
        IOobject
        (
            "transportProperties",
            runTime.constant(),
            mesh,
            IOobject::MUST_READ_IF_MODIFIED,
            IOobject::NO_WRITE
        )
    );

    Info<< "Reading diffusivity\n" << endl;
    dimensionedScalar gamma (transportProperties.lookup("gamma"));

    Info << "Reading/calculating face flux field phi" << nl << endl;
    surfaceScalarField phi
    (
        IOobject
        (
            "phi",
            runTime.timeName(),
            mesh,
            IOobject::READ_IF_PRESENT,
            IOobject::AUTO_WRITE
        ),
        fvc::interpolate(U) & mesh.Sf() // [(m s-1) * (m2) = (m3 s-1)] <=> flow rate
    );

    solve
    (
        fvm::div(phi, beta) // [(m-1) * (m s-1) * (kg m-3) = (kg m-3 s-1)] <=> flux of beta
        - fvm::laplacian(gamma, beta) // [(m2 s-1) * (m-2) * (kg m-3) = (kg m-3 s-1)] <=> flux of beta
    );

    volScalarField result
    (
        IOobject
        (
            "result",
            runTime.timeName(),
            mesh,
            IOobject::NO_READ,
            IOobject::AUTO_WRITE
        ),
        beta // copy all beta contents, including the BCs
    );
    result.write(); // force output

    Info << nl << "End" << nl << endl;

    return 0;
}
```

`beta` 与 `U` 通过 `MUST_READ` 从当前时间目录读取。`gamma` 从 `constant/transportProperties` 读取，`dimensionedScalar` 同时保存数值与量纲。

`phi` 采用 `READ_IF_PRESENT`：目录中已有通量场时读取该文件，否则按速度插值计算。使用已有求解结果作输入时，这个选择可以保留原求解器的通量。

`solve(...)` 将对流矩阵与扩散矩阵组合并求解，结果直接更新 `beta`。随后以 `beta` 构造 `result`，复制内部值和边界条件；`result.write()` 立即将它写入当前时间目录。本程序没有时间循环，所以查看输出时应选择当前目录中的 `result` 字段。

